    "When enabled, EqualEase requires a paired remote before it sends detailed state or accepts control commands. Keep this for trusted local networks: traffic is same-LAN only and not internet-grade encrypted. Pairing codes and tokens are never exposed through /health, /info, logs, or Settings after initial pairing.": {
